          {
            "text": "In the epoch plots, blue is control, orange is unknown regions, and grey is the unchanged starting model. Compare the validation curves, not the raw losses. Each quality point is one completed epoch on the same 12 patch-25 tiles; all four panels use score threshold 0.30."
