        "children": [
          {
            "text": "Higher and farther right is better. Each curve connects the four measured thresholds 0.20, 0.30, 0.40 and 0.50; the lines are visual guides, not extra measurements. Control and unknown always use their latest shared completed epoch. The starting model remains the epoch-0 reference. Legend labels identify each curve."
          }
